OL,3,AFrench becoming more effective in
OL,4,Astopping small boat crossings, UK says
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench police tactics are becoming more
OL,7,Feffective in stopping small boats in
OL,8,Fthe English Channel from reaching
OL,9,FBritain, the Home Office has said.
OL,11,FIt credits French authorities with
OL,12,Fintercepting 185 potential crossings
OL,13,Finvolving 4,300 migrants this summer
OL,14,Fover four separate weeks, as well as
OL,15,Fstopping 12 boats at sea using new
OL,16,Ftechniques.
OL,18,FFootage released by French police shows
OL,19,Fofficers racing across a beach in jeeps
OL,20,Fto intercept a launch. Once the boat is
OL,21,Fabandoned, an officer slashes it
OL,22,Flengthways with a knife.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
